---
import { ArrowRight, Clock } from 'lucide-astro';
---
<section class="mb-20">
  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6 mb-10 pb-6 border-b border-brand-ink/10 dark:border-white/10">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
      <div class="w-4 h-4 bg-brand-orange dark:bg-brand-bg shrink-0 rounded-sm"></div>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-ink dark:text-white">Entradas Recientes</h2>
    </div>
    
    <a href="/blog/pajaro-muerto" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-brand-orange dark:text-brand-bg uppercase tracking-[0.2em] hover:text-brand-ink dark:hover:text-white transition-colors group">
      Ver todas las publicaciones <ArrowRight class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" />
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-x-8 gap-y-16">
    <!-- Post 1 -->
    <article class="group cursor-pointer">
      <div class="aspect-[4/3] rounded-xl bg-brand-card dark:bg-neutral-900 mb-6 overflow-hidden relative shadow-lg">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-neutral-800 transition-transform duration-700 ease-in-out group-hover:scale-105">
           <!-- Placeholder for featured image -->
           <div class="w-full h-full bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_bottom_left,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-neutral-800 to-brand-ink opacity-70"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="flex flex-col">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
          <span class="text-brand-orange dark:text-brand-turquoise text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">Fotografía</span>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-[10px] md:text-xs text-brand-muted font-medium">
            <span>Oct 12, 2026</span>
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><Clock class="w-3 h-3" /> 6 min</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold mb-3 leading-snug text-brand-ink dark:text-white group-hover:text-brand-orange dark:group-hover:text-brand-bg transition-colors">
          La estética de las ruinas en el paisaje contemporáneo
        </h3>
        
        <p class="text-brand-ink/70 dark:text-neutral-400 font-medium mb-6 line-clamp-2 text-sm max-w-sm leading-relaxed">
          Un análisis visual sobre cómo los espacios abandonados redefinen nuestra relación con el tiempo.
        </p>
        
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mt-auto">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-card dark:bg-brand-darkCard flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold text-brand-ink dark:text-brand-muted border border-brand-ink/10 dark:border-white/5 uppercase shadow-inner">
            MU
          </div>
          <span class="text-[10px] md:text-xs font-semibold text-brand-ink/60 dark:text-white/50 uppercase tracking-widest">por Miguel Ángel Uribe</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Post 2 -->
    <article class="group cursor-pointer">
      <div class="aspect-[4/3] rounded-xl bg-brand-card dark:bg-neutral-900 mb-6 overflow-hidden relative shadow-lg">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-neutral-800 transition-transform duration-700 ease-in-out group-hover:scale-105">
           <div class="w-full h-full bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_bottom_left,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-neutral-800 to-brand-ink opacity-70"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="flex flex-col">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
          <span class="text-brand-orange dark:text-brand-turquoise text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">Paisaje Sonoro</span>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-[10px] md:text-xs text-brand-muted font-medium">
            <span>Sep 28, 2026</span>
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><Clock class="w-3 h-3" /> 12 min</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold mb-3 leading-snug text-brand-ink dark:text-white group-hover:text-brand-orange dark:group-hover:text-brand-bg transition-colors">
          Buscando el silencio en la metrópolis moderna
        </h3>
        
        <p class="text-brand-ink/70 dark:text-neutral-400 font-medium mb-6 line-clamp-2 text-sm max-w-sm leading-relaxed">
          Registros sonoros y reflexiones literarias sobre el significado de la quietud en Bogotá.
        </p>
        
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mt-auto">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-card dark:bg-brand-darkCard flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold text-brand-ink dark:text-brand-muted border border-brand-ink/10 dark:border-white/5 uppercase shadow-inner">
            JG
          </div>
          <span class="text-[10px] md:text-xs font-semibold text-brand-ink/60 dark:text-white/50 uppercase tracking-widest">por Jose Gómez</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Post 3 -->
    <article class="group cursor-pointer">
      <div class="aspect-[4/3] rounded-xl bg-brand-card dark:bg-neutral-900 mb-6 overflow-hidden relative shadow-lg">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-neutral-800 transition-transform duration-700 ease-in-out group-hover:scale-105">
           <div class="w-full h-full bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_bottom_left,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-neutral-800 to-brand-ink opacity-70"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="flex flex-col">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
          <span class="text-brand-orange dark:text-brand-turquoise text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">Entrevista</span>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-[10px] md:text-xs text-brand-muted font-medium">
            <span>Sep 15, 2026</span>
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><Clock class="w-3 h-3" /> 8 min</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold mb-3 leading-snug text-brand-ink dark:text-white group-hover:text-brand-orange dark:group-hover:text-brand-bg transition-colors">
          Diálogos inmateriales: el arte de narrar con luz
        </h3>
        
        <p class="text-brand-ink/70 dark:text-neutral-400 font-medium mb-6 line-clamp-2 text-sm max-w-sm leading-relaxed">
          Conversación íntima con directores emergentes del nuevo cine colombiano sobre su proceso creativo.
        </p>
        
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mt-auto">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-card dark:bg-brand-darkCard flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold text-brand-ink dark:text-brand-muted border border-brand-ink/10 dark:border-white/5 uppercase shadow-inner">
            MG
          </div>
          <span class="text-[10px] md:text-xs font-semibold text-brand-ink/60 dark:text-white/50 uppercase tracking-widest">por Mariana García</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
